                                "sense_id": "7d5b4972-01b6-37f2-a8ae-d37ce55beea0",
                                "text": "The pucks don’t bounce, the trains don’t spring, my cume is gonna fall,\nAnd unless I pass that final quiz I’ll be screwed right to the wall."
